**📅 Week 1: Local Docker Setup, RAG Pipeline & Video Transcript Extractor**

**Objective:**
Initialize the local monorepo, launch local Docker containers (Postgres, Redis, Qdrant, Langfuse), and build the local document ingestion pipeline with SHA-256 hash checking.

**Key Tasks:**

**Repository & Local Environment Setup:**
Create monorepo structure (apps/web, apps/api, scripts/, infra/).
Configure local docker-compose.yml spinning up local PostgreSQL 16, Redis 7, Qdrant Vector DB, and Langfuse.


**Local Database & Alembic Migrations:**
Define SQLAlchemy database models (threads, messages, feedback, document_hashes).
Run initial Alembic migration (alembic upgrade head) to seed local Postgres.

**Local Knowledge Ingestion Pipeline (scripts/ingest_knowledge_base.py):**
Build document loader for PDFs, Word files, and Synthesia MP4 training video transcripts.
Implement SHA-256 Document Hash Engine (apps/api/app/rag/hash_engine.py) to auto-purge legacy vector chunks when files update.
Embed document chunks using Google Vertex AI Embeddings (text-embedding-004) and store in local Qdrant.


**Deliverable:**
Local Docker stack running smoothly on developer workstation with company process guides and video scripts vectorized inside local Qdrant.

**📅 Week 2: Multi-Agent Engine, Guardrail Router & Guidance Reasoning**

**Objective:**
Build the core agent engine using LangGraph and Google Gemini 1.5 Pro & Flash to handle process Q&A, guardrails, and contact signposting.

**Key Tasks:**

**LangGraph State Schema (apps/api/app/agents/state.py):**
Define AgentState TypedDict schema passing thread history, retrieved RAG context, and signpost routing flags.

**Specialized Agent Nodes Development (apps/api/app/agents/nodes/):**

Node 0 (router.py): Gemini 1.5 Flash router (<300ms) for intent classification and filtering off-topic prompts.
Node 1 (reasoning.py): Gemini 1.5 Pro deep reasoning node that synthesizes step-by-step process guidance using strictly local Qdrant context.
Node 2 (signpost.py): Contact signpost generator that routes off-topic queries (e.g., Legal / Department Leads) to named human contacts.

**Context Optimization (BGE Reranker):**
Integrate local bge-reranker-large PyTorch model to re-rank Qdrant search results before passing context to Gemini.
Deliverable:
Fully functional backend multi-agent pipeline executable via local Python terminal tests, yielding accurate process guidance and proper contact signposting.



**📅 Week 3: ChatGPT-Style Web UI & Real-Time SSE Token Streaming**

**Objective:**
Build the responsive ChatGPT-Style Web UI and connect real-time Server-Sent Events (SSE) token streaming to the local FastAPI backend.

**Key Tasks:**

**ChatGPT UI Component Development (apps/web/components/):**

Sidebar Navigation: Collapsible left sidebar for managing chat thread history and new chat triggers.

Chat Workspace: Central message feed displaying streamed markdown text, source document pills, template badges, and timestamped video clip links.

Prompt Input Bar: Clean bottom input box with quick prompt suggestion chips ("What is Red Review?", "Where is the Answer Plan template?").

**FastAPI SSE Streaming Route (apps/api/app/api/v1/chat.py):**

Build /api/v1/chat/stream SSE endpoint to stream Gemini AI tokens in real time to the browser.

**Zustand State Store (apps/web/lib/store/useChatStore.ts):**
Manage local active thread selection, streaming text state, and thumbs up/down (👍/👎) feedback triggers.

**Deliverable:**
Working ChatGPT-style web interface running at http://localhost:3000 streaming real-time responses from the local FastAPI backend.




**📅 Week 4: Integration Testing, Anti-Poisoning Validation & Local QA**

**Objective:**
Conduct end-to-end integration tests, validate SHA-256 hash auto-purge functionality, test 14-day Redis memory retirement, and polish UI edge cases.

**Key Tasks:**

**Anti-Poisoning & Invalidation Testing:**

Test scenario: Modify an existing process PDF in ./data/company_docs/ and re-run ingestion. Verify old vector chunks are hard-purged from local Qdrant.

**Automated Testing Suite (apps/api/tests/):**

Write pytest unit tests for Node 0 router intent classification accuracy.

Write integration tests verifying RAG search retrieval and BGE reranking.

**UI Polish & Feedback System:**

Connect thumbs up/down (👍/👎) rating buttons to store user feedback in local PostgreSQL.

Verify responsiveness across Chrome, Edge, Safari, and Firefox.

**Deliverable:**

Tested, bug-free application running entirely on local Docker desktop with verified anti-poisoning auto-purge logic.




**📅 Week 5: Local Demo Preparation, Test Case Seeding & Stakeholder Showcase**

**Objective:**
Seed realistic demonstration test cases, prepare a live local demo script, and showcase the working application to stakeholders on a laptop/workstation.

**Key Tasks:**

**Demo Data Seeding:**

Ingest sample Work Winning process guides, Red/Pink Review documentation, Answer Plan templates, and Synthesia MP4 video script transcripts.

**Live Demo Script Preparation:**

Demo Scenario 1 (Process Q&A): "What is the difference between a Red Review and a Pink Review?" ➔ Demonstrates Gemini Pro process reasoning + Synthesia video clip badge.

Demo Scenario 2 (Resource Search): "Where is the official Answer Plan template stored?" ➔ Demonstrates direct SharePoint template link badge.

Demo Scenario 3 (Guardrail & Signposting): "What are the legal golden rules for contract liabilities?" ➔ Demonstrates off-topic guardrail & signposting user to Legal / Christine.

Demo Scenario 4 (Anti-Poisoning Proof): Update a sample process document locally, re-index, and show the AI immediately using the updated rule without old hallucinated context.

**Stakeholder Showcase Presentation:**

Present live 15-minute demonstration running on local laptop (http://localhost:3000).

**Deliverable:**

Successful live local stakeholder showcase proving system accuracy, instant response streaming, and zero-cloud-server dependency.